%% Current implementation status: there is no production inference entry point
%% or Stage 1 -> Stage 2 cascade class in this repository. This sequence shows
%% the inference-like evaluation that the trainers actually implement.
sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Trainer
    participant F as audio/features.py
    participant C as FeatureCache (optional)
    participant N as artefacts.py normalizer
    participant M as Keras model
    participant E as Evaluation artefacts

    T->>F: extract_original_tensors(records, config)
    F->>C: get(content-addressed key)
    alt cache hit
        C-->>F: verified tensor
    else cache miss
        F->>F: load_preprocessed_waveform(path)<br/>extract_features(waveform, config)
        F->>C: put(tensor + SHA-256 metadata)
        C-->>F: immutable cached tensor
    end
    F-->>T: original-only feature tensor + labels + record IDs
    T->>N: load_normalizer(expected run_id/fold)
    N-->>T: NormalizerStats
    T->>N: apply_normalizer(features, stats)
    N-->>T: normalized tensor
    T->>M: model.predict(normalized tensor)
    M-->>T: softmax scores
    T->>E: OOF or final_test predictions and metrics

    Note over T,E: A user-facing WAV inference sequence and Stage 1 → Stage 2 routing are not implemented here.
